//! BDD Behavioral Contract Verification for vo-actor
//!
//! This module verifies behavioral contracts via Given/When/Then tests
//! exercising only the public API. Three lenses are applied:
//! 1. Liar Check — does implementation match documented claims?
//! 2. Breakage Check — what happens when conditions degrade?
//! 3. Completeness Check — is every public item exercised?
//!
//! Generated by bdd-enforcer for ve-be5o8.

